Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ui): collect the modal-dialog wait at the ui phase
 too; drop 'furniture' from user text

Panels open file dialogs while drawing, after the one-per-frame take, so a
30 s browse logged a slow ui frame and excused the next frame. Collect the
wait before the ui mark; excuse is clamped so stamps never pass now.
Reword the user-facing 'furniture' messages.

Refs #872

